  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helvetas Ukraina - Arbetsmarknadsinsats f&#xf6;r s&#xe5;rbara grupper 2024-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helvetas Ukraine - Integration of vulnerable groups into labour market 2024-2026 - Helvetas - Labour market capacity and sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets syfte &#xe4;r att kvinnor och s&#xe5;rbara grupper i samh&#xe4;llet skall integreras p&#xe5; arbetsmarknaden, deras motst&#xe5;ndskraft skall &#xf6;ka, och deras m&#xf6;jligheter till lokal aff&#xe4;rsutveckling skall f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of this project is that women and vulnerable groups will be integrated into the labour market, their resilience will be increased, and their access to business development opportunities will be improved. The proposed project is addressing both the deficit of workforce as well as the underemployment among vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of this project is that women and vulnerable groups will be integrated into the labour market, their resilience will be increased, and their access to business development opportunities will be improved. The proposed project is addressing both the deficit of workforce as well as the underemployment among vulnerable groups.

Two outcomes are expected:

1) Vulnerable groups and women improve their economic situation and livelihoods. 

2) Ukrainian labour market organisations increase their institutional capacity to include women and vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
